{"question_text": {"৪৯তম বিসিএস ⎯ গণিত (৫৫১)": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_130323.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"103\">is a-<br>", "option1": "<span lang=\"EN-GB\">improper integral of the first kind</span><br>", "option2": "<span lang=\"EN-GB\">improper integral of the second kind</span><br>", "option3": "<span lang=\"EN-GB\">improper integral of the third kind</span><br>", "option4": "none<br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_130947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"163\"></p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) <span lang=\"EN-GB\">What is the </span>integration<span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_131044.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"209\" height=\"99\"></span>", "option1": "convergence", "option2": "divergence", "option3": "A + B", "option4": "none", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_131338.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"538\" height=\"83\"></p>\r\n<p>Since the value of integration is finite. So convergence.</p>\r\n<p> N.B: convergence, when the value of integration is finite. </p>\r\n<p>        divergence, when the value of integration is infinite</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) <span lang=\"EN-GB\">What is the </span>integration<span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_131529.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"103\"></span>", "option1": "convergence&nbsp;&nbsp;", "option2": "divergence", "option3": "A + B", "option4": "none", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_1CJCvY2.png\" width=\"657\" height=\"118\"></p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) <span lang=\"EN-GB\">What is the </span>integration <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_133956.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"357\" height=\"156\">", "option1": "convergence", "option2": "divergence", "option3": "A+B", "option4": "none", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_134040.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"592\" height=\"133\"></p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) <span lang=\"EN-GB\">What is the </span>integration <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_134119.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"229\" height=\"109\">", "option1": "convergence", "option2": "divergence", "option3": "A+B", "option4": "none", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/16_hgxcK5U.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"598