st-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_141751.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"325\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) Which is the equation represent the cycloid?", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"40\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142025.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"507\" height=\"44\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142037.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"531\" height=\"40\">", "option4": "All are correct", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"388\" height=\"240\"></p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) What is the area of bounded by <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142542.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"387\" height=\"41\">\r\n<!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMath><i\r\n style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n 107%;font-family:\"Cambria Math\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Nirmala UI\";\r\n mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><m:r><span\r\n  style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span></m:r></span></i></m:oMath><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><!--[endif]-->", "option1": "32", "option2": "23", "option3": "16", "option4": "56", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142621.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"54\"></p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) What is the area of the region bounded by the curve <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142702.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"273\" height=\"102\">", "option1": "ab", "option2": "2ab", "option3": "πab", "option4": "π(a + b)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142757.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"760\" height=\"265\"></p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) What is the area of the region bounded by the cycloid <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_142856.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"46\">&nbsp;", "option1": "ab", "option2": "2ab", "option3": "πab", "option4": "3πa<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143007.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"458\"></p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) What represent the <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143139.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"455\" height=\"37\">", "option1": "Limacon", "option2": "Cardioid", "option3": "Lemniscate", "option4": "Loop", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143214.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"619\" height=\"148\"></p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) What represent the r = a + b cosθ?", "option1": "Limacon", "option2": "Cardioid", "option3": "Lemniscate", "option4": "Loop", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143352.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"166\"></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) What represent the r = a sinnθ or r = a cosnθ?", "option1": "Limacon", "option2": "Cardioid", "option3": "Lemniscate", "option4": "Loop", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>1. represent Cardioide r = a(1 + cosθ) or r = a(1 - cosθ)</p>\r\n<p>2. represent Limacon r = a + b cosθ</p>\r\n<p>3. represent Lemniscate r<sup>2 </sup>= a<sup>2</sup> cos2θ</p>\r\n<p>4. represent Loop r = a sin nθ or r = a cos nθ  </p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) Which is the right relation of Cartesian coordinate and polar coordinate?", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143739.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"49\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143750.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"48\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"563\" height=\"51\">", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143825.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"43\">", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>The right relation of Cartesian coordinate and polar coordinate is <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_143924.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"498\" height=\"44\"></p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) How many loop of r = a sin3θ?\r\n<!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMath><i\r\n style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n 107%;font-family:\"Cambria Math\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast'><m:r> </m:r><m:r>θ</m:r></span></i></m:oMath><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]-->\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<!--[endif]-->", "option1": "6", "option2": "3", "option3": "0", "option4": "none", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>If r=asin nθ or r=acos nθ, n∈ N then the number of loop</p>\r\n<p>n, when n is odd</p>\r\n<p>2n, when n is even</p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) How many loop of r= a sin4θ ?", "option1": "4", "option2": "0", "option3": "16", "option4": "8", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>If r=asin nθ or r=acos nθ, n∈ N then the number of loop=n, when n is odd <br>2n, when n is even</p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) What is the area of r<sup>2 </sup>= a<sup>2</sup> cos2θ for all loop?", "option1": "2a<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "πa<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "a<sup>2</sup>/2", "option4": "a<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_151606.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"252\"></p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) What is the arc length (চাপ দৈর্ঘ্য) of the curve y = f(x) in the interval [a, b]?", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_151705.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"78\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_151719.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"245\" height=\"74\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_151730.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"229\" height=\"89\">", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_151743.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"229\" height=\"77\">", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>The  arc length (চাপ দৈর্ঘ ) of the curve y= f(x) in the interval [a, b] is <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_151801.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"82\"></p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) What is the length of the arc of the line y = ln (sec x) from x = 0 to x = π/4", "option1": "ln(√2 - 1)", "option2": "2ln(√2 + 1)", "option3": "2ln(√2 - 1)", "option4": "ln(√2 + 1)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-31_152024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"651\" height=\"249\"></p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) What is the perimeter (পরিসীমা) of the cardioid r = a(1 + cosθ)&nbsp;", "option1": "a", "option2": "2a", "option3": "4a", "option4": "8a", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/8_u4xbK6F.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"597\" height=\"403\"></p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) What is denoted by r = a?", "option1": "circle, whice center is (0, 0)", "option2": "circle, whice center is (a, 0)", "option3": "spiral (কুন্ডলী), whice center is (0, 0)", "option4": "spiral (কুন্ডলী), &nbsp;whice center is (a ,0)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>r = a দ্বারা মূলবিন্দু কেন্দ্র ও a ব্যাসার্ধ বিশিষ্ট বৃত্ত নির্দশ করে।</p>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) What is denoted by r = aθ?\r\n<!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMath><i\r\n style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n 107%;font-family:\"Cambria Math\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\n EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><m:r>θ</m:r></span></i></m:oMath><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><!--[endif]-->", "option1": "circle, whice cente